description	"Jedi Acrobat 

A speedster that excels at flanking, ambushing, and aerial combat.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 12% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Dual/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (3)
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- 15% less Dual/8% more Blue damage
-- 35% more special damage
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 50% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (1)
- Speed (3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (1)
- Aerial Force Regen
- Sense Immunity

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]"